comments.message:
Certificate path as per design(https://github.com/openbmc/docs/blob/master/designs/redfish-spdm-attestation.md) will use following path

/xyz/openbmc_project/certs/devices/{chassis_id}/{cert_id}

Certificate URI will be /redfish/v1/Chassis/{ChassisId}/TrustedComponents/{TrustedComponentId}

spdm daemon implementation:
https://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/spdm/+/83094/10/requester/component_integrity_dbus.cpp#378
